  "instruction": "Enable Sticky Keys as a motor accessibility aid and keep it enabled. I take my Parkinson's medication at 8:00 AM, 12:00 PM, and 4:00 PM each day to help manage my movement symptoms. In Thunderbird Calendar, create three daily medication reminders at these times. Set the title of each reminder to `Parkinson's medication` and make each reminder repeat daily.",
  "source": "https://www.parkinsons.org.au/i-have-parkinsons/?utm_term=parkinson%27s%20australia&utm_campaign=GD+%7C+Parkinson%27s+Search+Campaign&utm_source=adwords&utm_medium=ppc&hsa_acc=5551006727&hsa_cam=21391943163&hsa_grp=171009508227&hsa_ad=714906645515&hsa_src=g&hsa_tgt=kwd-1098016929&hsa_kw=parkinson%27s%20australia&hsa_mt=b&hsa_net=adwords&hsa_ver=3&gad_source=1&gad_campaignid=21391943163&gbraid=0AAAAA95bhWomStfjYCr6l0hTkNSewGFQP&gclid=CjwKCAjwvNfSBhBiEiwAyaGMCX2KqU9452XhOdtpFtJHcnRlNrV7zkjSFVHArqsXNOWt8bCLJ5LT8hoCQOYQAvD_BwE",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Open Windows Settings.",
    "Navigate to Accessibility.",
    "Open Keyboard accessibility settings.",
    "Turn on Sticky Keys and keep it enabled.",
    "Open Thunderbird Calendar.",
    "In the Calendars list, enable the Home calendar if it is disabled.",
    "Create a calendar event at 8:00 AM.",
    "Set the title to `Parkinson's medication`.",
    "Set the 8:00 AM event to repeat daily.",
    "Save the 8:00 AM event.",
    "Create a calendar event at 12:00 PM.",
    "Set the title to `Parkinson's medication`.",
    "Set the 12:00 PM event to repeat daily.",
    "Save the 12:00 PM event.",
    "Create a calendar event at 4:00 PM.",
    "Set the title to `Parkinson's medication`.",
    "Set the 4:00 PM event to repeat daily.",
    "Save the 4:00 PM event.",
    "Leave Sticky Keys enabled."
  ],
